<% layout("/layout/boilerplate") %>
<body>
  <div class="policy-container">
    <h1
      class="text-center my-4 d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center"
    >
      <span
        ><img
          src="/assets/favicon.ico"
          alt="NaeVerse Logo"
          style="height: 65px" /></span
      >NaeVerse
    </h1>

    <section>
      <h2>About Us</h2>
      <p>
        Welcome to NaeVerse, a modern social media platform inspired by TikTok.
        We enable users to share images and videos, connect with others, and
        discover engaging content.
      </p>
      <p>
        NaeVerse was developed by Naeemullah, a Software Engineering student, as
        part of an internship project for CodeAlpha. The project was built
        between 1 May 2026 and 29 May 2026 and was completed in approximately 10
        days.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        Our goal is to provide a simple, responsive, and feature-rich social
        media experience where users can:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Create and share posts</li>
        <li>Like and comment on content</li>
        <li>Follow and unfollow other users</li>
        <li>Search for users and posts</li>
        <li>Customize their profiles</li>
        <li>Switch between light and dark mode</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What Makes NaeVerse Special</h2>
      <p>
        NaeVerse includes both required internship features and several advanced
        enhancements, such as:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>For You and Following feeds</li>
        <li>Liked posts tab</li>
        <li>Full account deletion with data cleanup</li>
        <li>Profile picture and password updates</li>
        <li>Quick follow button directly from posts</li>
        <li>Mobile-friendly navigation</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Technology Used</h2>
      <p>NaeVerse is built with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Node.js</li>
        <li>Express.js</li>
        <li>MongoDB</li>
        <li>Mongoose</li>
        <li>EJS</li>
        <li>Cloudinary</li>
        <li>Bootstrap</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Developed by</h2>
      <p>
        This website is designed and developed by Naeemullah, a final-year
        Software Engineering student at the University of Swat and a MERN Stack
        Web Developer.
      </p>
    </section>
